<title>SINGAPORE: ITE Electric Malaysian unit sets up firm.</title>
<headline>ITE Electric Malaysian unit sets up firm.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>ITE Electric Co Ltd said on Friday its Malaysian unit had set up a subsidiary to manufacture and supply electric and electronic products and components.</p>
<p>Electech Distribution System Sdn Bhd, which is wholly owned by ITE, would establish a subsidiary called Electech Manufacturing Sdn Bhd, a company statement said.</p>
<p>The subsidiary would apply for a manufacturing licence from the Malaysian Industrial Development Authority.</p>
<p>- Singapore Newsroom (65-8703080)</p>
</text>
